  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fvEA_8lzZ3cGyjkIEaxwsDTH_zQUGL0cGe6xBdb_b2E.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>Number of masses will remain constant<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\mathrm{n}_1+\\mathrm{n}_2=\\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{f}} \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{P}_1 \\mathrm{~V}_1}{\\mathrm{RT}_1}+\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_2 \\mathrm{~V}_2}{\\mathrm{RT}_2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}} \\mathrm{~V}_{\\mathrm{f}}}{\\mathrm{RT}_{\\mathrm{f}}} \\\\\n& \\frac{8 \\times 2 \\mathrm{~V}}{\\mathrm{R} \\times 1000}+\\frac{7 \\times \\mathrm{V}}{\\mathrm{R} \\times 500}=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}(3 \\mathrm{~V})}{\\mathrm{R} \\times 600} \\\\\n& \\frac{16}{1000}+\\frac{14}{1000}=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}}{\\mathrm{R} \\times 600} \\\\\n& \\frac{30}{1000}=\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}}{200} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}=6 \\mathrm{kPa}<br/>\\end{aligned}$",
